During the 1960–61 Scottish football season, [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] competed in [[Scottish Division One]].

Celtic advanced to the [[1960–61 Scottish Cup|Scottish Cup]] final, where they lost to [[Dunfermline Athletic F.C.|Dunfermline Athletic]].<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/the-montreal-star/158325600/|title=Dunfermline Tops Celtic In Scottish Cup|work=[[Montreal Star]]|date=27 April 1961|access-date=2 November 2024|page=64|via=[[Newspapers.com]]}}</ref> They also advanced to the [[Glasgow Cup]] final, where they lost to [[Partick Thistle F.C.|Partick Thistle]].<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/daily-record/158325873/|title=Celts Flounder To Cup Defeat|first=|last=|work=[[Daily Record (Scotland)|Daily Record]]|date=27 September 1960|access-date=2 November 2024|page=15|via=[[Newspapers.com]]}}</ref>

